  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using singleprofile data and pca_n2000 RNA encoding, without image modalities or fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.4849 suggests moderate performance for this baseline configuration. Uncertainty remains about the optimal RNA representation and profile settings, as well as the potential impact of multimodal components not evaluated here."
}

